{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "tinp6t8did1wq01v", "title": "115.基于DeepSpeed加速大模型训练", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"eJDVQ\" id=\"eJDVQ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6722c975\" id=\"u6722c975\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">示例代码</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u4f7dfaf3\" id=\"u4f7dfaf3\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fzip%2F2424104%2F1747713193633-9892dbbb-d48c-47b2-a37e-e99500b60901.zip%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22deepspeed-train.zip%22%2C%22size%22%3A8039%2C%22ext%22%3A%22zip%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue2e3db65-8885-4f42-b762-aab54d19886%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fzip%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5362e877%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"XP78e\" id=\"XP78e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6eebbbd0\" id=\"u6eebbbd0\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">DeepSpeed 介绍</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"kpbLz\" id=\"kpbLz\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0412bec\" id=\"ue0412bec\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">分布式背景介绍</span></h2><ul list=\"ub2a3f863\"><li fid=\"u92aac3a1\" data-lake-id=\"u2c72105b\" id=\"u2c72105b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c69163e\" id=\"u7c69163e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">分布式计算环境中，主节点负责协调其他节点和进程的工作</span></li><li fid=\"u92aac3a1\" data-lake-id=\"u487e14a6\" id=\"u487e14a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4aee93f1\" id=\"u4aee93f1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">pytorch 官方提供的分布式训练工具 Accelerate 只支持 nvlink，而 T4，3090 这类显卡是 PIX ，检测方式：nvidia-smi topo -m；deepspeed 支持更大规模的模型训练</span></li><li fid=\"u92aac3a1\" data-lake-id=\"ued698394\" id=\"ued698394\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e2b7963\" id=\"u8e2b7963\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">混合精度训练</span></li><li fid=\"u92aac3a1\" data-lake-id=\"u67ae84b8\" id=\"u67ae84b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6818b98f\" id=\"u6818b98f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">ZeRO 可以减少内存占用，优化大模型训练，将模型参数分成了三个部分：Optimizer States、Gradient 和 Model Parameter。在使用 ZeRO 进行分布式训练时，可以选择 ZeRO-Offload 和 ZeRO-Stage3 等不同的优化技术。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"NnDXu\" id=\"NnDXu\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50b1b87b\" id=\"u50b1b87b\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">deepspeed 介绍</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u0c6e6932\" id=\"u0c6e6932\"><a href=\"https://deepspeed.org.cn/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7c7e3f49\" id=\"u7c7e3f49\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4e1766d6\" id=\"u4e1766d6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">DeepSpeed</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uf8232f71\" id=\"uf8232f71\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\"> 是一个为速度和规模而设计的库，用于大规模模型的分布式训练，模型参数可达数十亿。其核心是零冗余优化器 (ZeRO)，它跨数据并行进程分片优化器状态 (ZeRO-1)、梯度 (ZeRO-2) 和参数 (ZeRO-3)。这大大减少了内存使用量，使您可以将训练扩展到数十亿参数的模型。为了释放更高</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1d73e54e\" id=\"u1d73e54e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">的内存效率，</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5d3d06c8\" id=\"u5d3d06c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000\">ZeRO-Offload 通过在优化期间利用 CPU 资源来减少 GPU </span></p><ul list=\"u94b1cd6b\"><li fid=\"u29c9df89\" data-lake-id=\"u13866ac5\" id=\"u13866ac5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u37ff6507\" id=\"u37ff6507\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">在 DeepSpeed 中，可以通过在配置文件中设置 “bf16.enabled”: true 来启用 BF16 混合精度训练，减少占用内存。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u94b1cd6b\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u419ca3d2\" data-lake-id=\"uff0e519b\" id=\"uff0e519b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u558d8cab\" id=\"u558d8cab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">混合精度训练是指在训练过程中同时使用 FP16（半精度浮点数）和 FP32（单精度浮点数）两种精度的技术。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u94b1cd6b\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u29c9df89\" data-lake-id=\"ufc1ae3a2\" id=\"ufc1ae3a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a7c6653\" id=\"u2a7c6653\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">deepspeed 可以根据具体情况选择合适的通信库，例如在 CPU 集群上进行分布式训练，可以选择 mpi 和 gloo；如果是在 GPU 上进行分布式训练，可以选择 nccl。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u94b1cd6b\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u7fff96f4\" data-lake-id=\"u8bea5d40\" id=\"u8bea5d40\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98f7a1c6\" id=\"u98f7a1c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">mpi 是一种跨节点通信库，常用于 CPU 集群上的分布式训练；</span></li><li fid=\"u7fff96f4\" data-lake-id=\"ua4267e48\" id=\"ua4267e48\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33f6b23c\" id=\"u33f6b23c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">gloo 是一种高性能的分布式训练框架，支持 CPU 和 GPU 上的分布式训练；</span></li><li fid=\"u7fff96f4\" data-lake-id=\"u733ebb1e\" id=\"u733ebb1e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6cd1072\" id=\"ud6cd1072\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">nccl 是 NVIDIA 提供的 GPU 专用通信库，被广泛应用于 GPU 上的分布式训练。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u94b1cd6b\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u29c9df89\" data-lake-id=\"u2a631f83\" id=\"u2a631f83\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e4f7dce\" id=\"u1e4f7dce\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">DeepSpeed 的核心技术：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u94b1cd6b\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u72fc97e8\" data-lake-id=\"u56feae36\" id=\"u56feae36\"><span data-lake-id=\"u25e1139d\" id=\"u25e1139d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Zero（Zero Redundancy Optimizer，3D 优化与卸载）：在 deepspeed 中通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u00cc2e93\" id=\"u00cc2e93\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1f29b5d\" id=\"ue1f29b5d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">zero_optimization.stage=0/1/2/3</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua330c7e6\" id=\"ua330c7e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 设置，卸载通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u938c6e89\" id=\"u938c6e89\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf00177f8\" id=\"uf00177f8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">zero_optimization.offload_optimizer.device</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u58c7214c\" id=\"u58c7214c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">设置</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u94b1cd6b\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u29c9df89\" data-lake-id=\"u154deaaa\" id=\"u154deaaa\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub427fd3d\" id=\"ub427fd3d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">DeepSpeed 的推理优化技术：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u94b1cd6b\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u0fd09873\" data-lake-id=\"ufbae471e\" id=\"ufbae471e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua88df803\" id=\"ua88df803\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Deep fusion：如下图，红色虚线框是以该单位为优化 Kernel，对应的数字是优化的效率倍数</span></li><li fid=\"u0fd09873\" data-lake-id=\"u7c80bc7b\" id=\"u7c80bc7b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11b4378d\" id=\"u11b4378d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Inference-customized GeMM</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u1eab2f55\" id=\"u1eab2f55\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1747032030920-2272a798-bd9d-42bc-9f1e-b6d12c0afe50.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u47198fd2-be49-4a60-921f-1d4259e2c4d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua44f2a26-e3d0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A831%2C%22originHeight%22%3A555%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c8daaf%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3b35942b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"jTLph\" id=\"jTLph\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36ff3cad\" id=\"u36ff3cad\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">微调训练</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"MoGgj\" id=\"MoGgj\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6e1d451a\" id=\"u6e1d451a\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">环境准备</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u5dab92a9\" id=\"u5dab92a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5825d6a2\" id=\"u5825d6a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">推荐的第三方库版本参考</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/intro/swift-installation\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4805945b\" id=\"u4805945b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u396724fc\" id=\"u396724fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">SWIFT安装文档</span></a></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20ms-swift%20-U%5Cn%5Cn%23%20deepspeed%20zero2%2Fzero3%5Cnpip%20install%20deepspeed%20-U%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uSsBo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"Fh4ZR\" id=\"Fh4ZR\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d6df27c\" id=\"u1d6df27c\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">微调</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u740c66d3\" id=\"u740c66d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u637780e9\" id=\"u637780e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">ms-swift使用了分层式的设计思想，用户可以使用命令行界面、Web-UI界面和直接使用Python的方式进行微调。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"e4dXR\" id=\"e4dXR\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6cda9c5\" id=\"ue6cda9c5\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用CLI</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u82aff6eb\" id=\"u82aff6eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89547724\" id=\"u89547724\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">我们提供了10分钟在单卡A10上对</span><span data-lake-id=\"u31f0f51f\" id=\"u31f0f51f\" style=\"color: #080808; background-color: #ffffff\">Qwen2-1.5B</span><span data-lake-id=\"ubfe161b8\" id=\"ubfe161b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行自我认知微调的最佳实践，具体参考</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/intro/quickstart\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3a98fe37\" id=\"u3a98fe37\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6503677d\" id=\"u6503677d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uef90bb28\" id=\"uef90bb28\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，这可以帮助您快速了解SWIFT。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6f2eb438\" id=\"u6f2eb438\"><span data-lake-id=\"u20b98be0\" id=\"u20b98be0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">此外，我们给出了一系列脚本帮助您了解SWIFT的训练能力：</span></p><ul list=\"ue8c801ef\"><li fid=\"u7f9c2e2e\" data-lake-id=\"u326ab3cd\" id=\"u326ab3cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0d24e7f\" id=\"ue0d24e7f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">DeepSpeed ZeRO2/ZeRO3: 节约显存资源，但训练速度下降。ZeRO2将对优化器状态、模型梯度进行分片。ZeRO3在ZeRO2基础上，对模型参数进行分片，更加节约显存，但训练速度更慢。参考</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/tree/main/examples/train/multi-gpu/deepspeed\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucd0ce9f9\" id=\"ucd0ce9f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76c8addf\" id=\"u76c8addf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub65e563c\" id=\"ub65e563c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u7f9c2e2e\" data-lake-id=\"ua5232ed5\" id=\"ua5232ed5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65ef7196\" id=\"u65ef7196\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">多机多卡训练: 我们书写了使用swift、torchrun、dlc、deepspeed、accelerate启动多节点运行的shell脚本示例。除了dlc和deepspeed，其他启动脚本都需要在所有节点中启动才可运行。具体参考</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/swift/blob/main/examples/train/multi-node\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u22db2f0a\" id=\"u22db2f0a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77c280f6\" id=\"u77c280f6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u636733f6\" id=\"u636733f6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ud20699ec\" id=\"ud20699ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3accd2e\" id=\"uc3accd2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">小帖士：</span></p><ul list=\"uaa3a2d6d\"><li fid=\"uc0dbd581\" data-lake-id=\"u8a98a30b\" id=\"u8a98a30b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76f7b983\" id=\"u76f7b983\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">在使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8660f765\" id=\"u8660f765\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36d2a34d\" id=\"u36d2a34d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">swift sft</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8dfd2ac5\" id=\"u8dfd2ac5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">通过LoRA技术微调base模型为chat模型时，有时需要手动设置模板。通过添加</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2743b0e0\" id=\"u2743b0e0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb46f951\" id=\"ueb46f951\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--template default</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u380a3a02\" id=\"u380a3a02\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">参数来避免base模型因未见过对话模板中的特殊字符而无法正常停止的情况。具体参考</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/tree/main/examples/train/base_to_chat\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua9e230e4\" id=\"ua9e230e4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a4e1e9b\" id=\"u7a4e1e9b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u913c61c8\" id=\"u913c61c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"uc0dbd581\" data-lake-id=\"uf3c063a9\" id=\"uf3c063a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d7afd97\" id=\"u0d7afd97\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">如果使用NPU进行训练，只需要将shell中的</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf34687ea\" id=\"uf34687ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd44e354\" id=\"udd44e354\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u031c059d\" id=\"u031c059d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">修改为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3217beae\" id=\"u3217beae\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec4813ce\" id=\"uec4813ce\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u419031b2\" id=\"u419031b2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"uc0dbd581\" data-lake-id=\"u2a7df279\" id=\"u2a7df279\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf10e5362\" id=\"uf10e5362\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">SWIFT默认在训练时设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8e9fc416\" id=\"u8e9fc416\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0667850f\" id=\"u0667850f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--gradient_checkpointing true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2dbc9e1e\" id=\"u2dbc9e1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">来节约显存，这会略微降低训练速度。</span></li><li fid=\"uc0dbd581\" data-lake-id=\"u38028f40\" id=\"u38028f40\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6e359a7\" id=\"ub6e359a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">如果要使用deepspeed，你需要安装deepspeed：</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc518af4a\" id=\"uc518af4a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08fc7619\" id=\"u08fc7619\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">pip install deepspeed -U</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udf6f8a27\" id=\"udf6f8a27\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。使用deepspeed可以节约显存，但会略微降低训练速度。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"TlnLI\" id=\"TlnLI\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ee9487e\" id=\"u8ee9487e\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">deepspeed Zero2微调</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%2018GiB%20*%202%5Cnnproc_per_node%3D1%5Cn%5CnCUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%2C1%20%5C%5C%5CnNPROC_PER_NODE%3D%24nproc_per_node%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20sft%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model%20Qwen%2FQwen2-1.5B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--train_type%20lora%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset%20'swift%2Fself-cognition%2310'%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--torch_dtype%20bfloat16%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--num_train_epochs%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_train_batch_size%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--per_device_eval_batch_size%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--learning_rate%201e-4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--lora_rank%208%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--lora_alpha%2032%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--target_modules%20all-linear%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--gradient_accumulation_steps%20%24(expr%2016%20%2F%20%24nproc_per_node)%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--eval_steps%20100%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--save_steps%20100%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--save_total_limit%202%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--logging_steps%205%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_length%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20output%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--system%20'You%20are%20a%20helpful%20assistant.'%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--warmup_ratio%200.05%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataloader_num_workers%204%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_author%20swift%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name%20swift-robot%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--deepspeed%20zero2%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MxszS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uec38b36f\" id=\"uec38b36f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucd64447b\" id=\"ucd64447b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">​</span></strong><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"P8nHb\" id=\"P8nHb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u985fbc77\" id=\"u985fbc77\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">deepspeed分布式微调</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20If%20your%20need%20only%20a%20part%20of%20the%20GPUs%20in%20every%20node%2C%20try%3A%5Cn%23%20--include%3D%5C%22worker-0%3A0%2C1%40worker-1%3A2%2C3%5C%22%5Cn%23--hostfile%3D.%2Fexamples%2Ftrain%2Fmulti-node-deepspeed%2Fhost.txt%5Cndeepspeed%20ms-swift%2Fswift%2Fcli%2Fsft.py%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model%20Qwen%2FQwen2-1.5B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--train_type%20lora%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--torch_dtype%20bfloat16%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataset%20'swift%2Fself-cognition%232'%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--num_train_epochs%201%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--lora_rank%208%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--lora_alpha%2032%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--learning_rate%201e-4%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--gradient_accumulation_steps%2016%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--eval_steps%20100%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--save_steps%20100%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--save_total_limit%202%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--logging_steps%205%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_author%20swift%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name%20swift-robot%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--gradient_checkpointing_kwargs%20'%7B%5C%22use_reentrant%5C%22%3A%20false%7D'%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jFssp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub82d8620\" id=\"ub82d8620\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5c4e8fb6\" id=\"u5c4e8fb6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">​</span></strong><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"h4RUT\" id=\"h4RUT\"><span data-lake-id=\"u113b9cdb\" id=\"u113b9cdb\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">debug微调</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua0e044ac\" id=\"ua0e044ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4681f4df\" id=\"u4681f4df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以使用以下方式进行debug，这与使用命令行微调是等价的，但此方式不支持分布式。微调命令行运行入口可以查看</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/blob/main/swift/cli/sft.py\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ufc3f0dd8\" id=\"ufc3f0dd8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf7f2e446\" id=\"uf7f2e446\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u48f9c2d2\" id=\"u48f9c2d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20swift.llm%20import%20sft_main%2C%20TrainArguments%5Cnresult%20%3D%20sft_main(TrainArguments(%5Cn%20%20%20%20model%3D'Qwen%2FQwen2.5-7B-Instruct'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_type%3D'lora'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20dataset%3D%5B'AI-ModelScope%2Falpaca-gpt4-data-zh%23500'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'AI-ModelScope%2Falpaca-gpt4-data-en%23500'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'swift%2Fself-cognition%23500'%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20torch_dtype%3D'bfloat16'%5Cn))%5Cnprint(result)%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yziOO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ucd4bddda\" id=\"ucd4bddda\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"FeJqk\" id=\"FeJqk\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue2f33c61\" id=\"ue2f33c61\">报错</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"whq5H\" id=\"whq5H\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue68ce202\" id=\"ue68ce202\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">RuntimeError: Expected to mark a variable ready only once</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"uad43ea90\" id=\"uad43ea90\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b8937f1\" id=\"u7b8937f1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">解决方案：</span><span data-lake-id=\"u71f2e526\" id=\"u71f2e526\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">添加--gradient_checkpointing_kwargs '{&quot;use_reentrant&quot;: false}'之后就可以正常微调了</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u34c40114\" id=\"u34c40114\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d20a8e4\" id=\"u0d20a8e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">参考：</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/issues/3446\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u15cbc1e7\" id=\"u15cbc1e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc98ddbff\" id=\"uc98ddbff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/issues/3446</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u46176e63\" id=\"u46176e63\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"IpveP\" id=\"IpveP\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub937625a\" id=\"ub937625a\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">Merge LoRA</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20Since%20%60output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%60%20is%20trained%20by%20swift%20and%20contains%20an%20%60args.json%60%20file%2C%5Cn%23%20there%20is%20no%20need%20to%20explicitly%20set%20%60--model%60%2C%20%60--system%60%2C%20etc.%2C%20as%20they%20will%20be%20automatically%20read.%5Cnswift%20export%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--merge_lora%20true%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eUGQx%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"t1PO5\" id=\"t1PO5\"><span data-lake-id=\"udbecc573\" id=\"udbecc573\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">推理（微调后模型）</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4f68c2a6\" id=\"u4f68c2a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55ad34d9\" id=\"u55ad34d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用CLI对LoRA训练的checkpoint进行推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--stream%20true%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XfRdt%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u7c73a1f6\"><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"uc131508d\" id=\"uc131508d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e531f3b\" id=\"u7e531f3b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">adapters文件夹中包含了训练的参数文件</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9e21344f\" id=\"u9e21344f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36519765\" id=\"u36519765\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">args.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u529e64fa\" id=\"u529e64fa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，因此不需要额外指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"u80a9b9c0\" id=\"u80a9b9c0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7bfe06b\" id=\"ue7bfe06b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--model</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5e0eab87\" id=\"u5e0eab87\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u49abd035\" id=\"u49abd035\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a11756b\" id=\"u7a11756b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--system</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud14ac179\" id=\"ud14ac179\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，swift会自动读取这些参数。如果要关闭此行为，可以设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue81355d8\" id=\"ue81355d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ffd46f0\" id=\"u9ffd46f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--load_args false</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u82cdc8c1\" id=\"u82cdc8c1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"udc8c61fe\" id=\"udc8c61fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90964df3\" id=\"u90964df3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">如果使用全参数训练，请使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ucb490534\" id=\"ucb490534\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3d93d01\" id=\"uc3d93d01\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--model</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0c33fc64\" id=\"u0c33fc64\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">替代</span><code data-lake-id=\"udf17b98c\" id=\"udf17b98c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a5f96c6\" id=\"u7a5f96c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--adapters</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u60dd54cc\" id=\"u60dd54cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">指定训练的checkpoint目录。更多参考。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"uc948bfcf\" id=\"uc948bfcf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c56187d\" id=\"u7c56187d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7747f4b4\" id=\"u7747f4b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueabf35fb\" id=\"ueabf35fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">swift app</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u032ae0fd\" id=\"u032ae0fd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">替代</span><code data-lake-id=\"u4b77e900\" id=\"u4b77e900\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8d418996\" id=\"u8d418996\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">swift infer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud43746e4\" id=\"ud43746e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行界面推理。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"u1f4ab26e\" id=\"u1f4ab26e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65fa9295\" id=\"u65fa9295\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以选择对LoRA进行merge（额外指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5271d203\" id=\"u5271d203\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud73c43ba\" id=\"ud73c43ba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--merge_lora true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u94e297ef\" id=\"u94e297ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">），然后指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue86141ba\" id=\"ue86141ba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3fedcab\" id=\"ue3fedcab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--infer_backend vllm/lmdeploy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4053ea18\" id=\"u4053ea18\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行推理加速。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u7725fcb3\" id=\"u7725fcb3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72359add\" id=\"u72359add\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">对数据集中的验证集进行批量推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--load_data_args%20true%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_batch_size%201%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mzmYA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u42c65fe6\"><li fid=\"u9353fec2\" data-lake-id=\"ue21d4700\" id=\"ue21d4700\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d1c232d\" id=\"u5d1c232d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub305ebb2\" id=\"ub305ebb2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f4533f0\" id=\"u1f4533f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--max_batch_size 8</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uacab7432\" id=\"uacab7432\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，从而使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue5b115ce\" id=\"ue5b115ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38092193\" id=\"u38092193\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--infer_backend pt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u918d5ea0\" id=\"u918d5ea0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行批量处理。若使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubbe1fe71\" id=\"ubbe1fe71\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd5371b8\" id=\"ubd5371b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">infer_backend vllm/lmdeploy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua32bdb4a\" id=\"ua32bdb4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">则无需指定，会进行自动batch。</span></li><li fid=\"u9353fec2\" data-lake-id=\"u50ff7262\" id=\"u50ff7262\"><code data-lake-id=\"ufb2f0e75\" id=\"ufb2f0e75\"><span data-lake-id=\"u68d0ef4d\" id=\"u68d0ef4d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--load_data_args true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0396da45\" id=\"u0396da45\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">会额外读取训练存储参数文件</span><code data-lake-id=\"u00cbc99f\" id=\"u00cbc99f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u393db13b\" id=\"u393db13b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">args.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufe0f7c2e\" id=\"ufe0f7c2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">中的数据参数。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u6f436f05\" id=\"u6f436f05\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9ac5aec\" id=\"ud9ac5aec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">若想对额外的测试集进行推理，而不使用训练时的验证集，使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7d549100\" id=\"u7d549100\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3b19bf8\" id=\"uf3b19bf8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--val_dataset &lt;dataset_path&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub4c9ad98\" id=\"ub4c9ad98\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--val_dataset%20%3Cdataset-path%3E%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_batch_size%201%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G7aAf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uebf4c10f\" id=\"uebf4c10f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae5d47ae\" id=\"uae5d47ae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用Python对训练后LoRA推理的例子如下：</span></p><card type=\"inli